# Google Apps Script web-app URL (Deploy > New deployment > Web app > Anyone).
# Set karne par dashboard live sheet se data uthata hai; khali chhodne par
# data/rolls.json ka built-in snapshot chalta hai.
#
# Response teen me se koi bhi shape ho sakta hai:
#   [ { "Sheet Name": ..., "Inward Date": ... }, ... ]
#   { "status": "success", "total": 1773, "data": [ ... ] }
#   CSV text
#
# Hamesha /exec wala URL dein. script.googleusercontent.com/macros/echo?user_content_key=...
# wala link sirf redirect target hai aur kuch der baad expire ho jata hai.
APPS_SCRIPT_URL=
